4. Does a saver that REFUSES a write propagate through Pregel?
==============================================================================
  raised: builtins.PermissionError: FENCED OUT: run reassigned to another worker
  --> a saver refusal propagates as a raw exception; there is no
      typed rejection the runtime treats specially.
  aput call count: 4
  state after refusal: next=() values={'steps': []}
